* Task 16 fixture: combined data-access extraction integration test
* Exercises reads (READ, FIND, GET + GET SAME), writes (STORE, record
* UPDATE/DELETE), DEFINE DATA with LOCAL/PARAMETER/GLOBAL sections,
* and DEFINE WORK FILE — all in one file to prove end-to-end extraction.

DEFINE DATA
LOCAL
  1 #COUNTER (N5)
  1 #REPORT-NAME (A30)
PARAMETER
  1 #INPUT-FILE (A50)
  1 #OUTPUT-PATH (A50)
GLOBAL USING EMPLOYEES-GDA
END-DEFINE

DEFINE WORK FILE 1 'REPORT.TXT'
DEFINE WORK FILE 2 #LOGFILE

* Read the primary view
READ EMPLOYEES
  * Update the current record
  UPDATE
END

* Find by descriptor
FIND VEHICLES WITH MAKE = 'TOYOTA'

* Get by ISN
GET DEPARTMENTS (#ISN)

* Get same (no target; skipped in extraction)
GET SAME

* Store a new record
STORE EMPLOYEES

* Read another view and delete
READ LOCATIONS
  DELETE (VAR1)
END

WRITE 'Done'

END
